58905273`\n- Exact implementation post-merge validation: `33759112770`\n- Closure materialization head: `b59ed10f423d4a66e7e47d66ec764b7ff22531e7`\n- Closure validation run: `33761024228`\n- Accepted owner-authored closure head: `ae715e4b7ea045389933c1037da83394f7c1fe27`\n- Closure exact-head workflow matrix: 25 successful workflows\n- Closure aggregate Core CI: `33789767303`\n\n## Validation\n\nPost-merge Core CI and the independent exact-merge Increment 34 validator both passed on implementation merge `a9d3ec50799953c41e7b9cf1d8bd6a2c5c9afd49`.\n\nThe closure controller passed the Increment 32, Increment 33, and Increment 34 structural checkers and mutation suites, Scala API/testkit build, runtime and public-construction witnesses, native compiler build and tests, direct diagnostic fixtures, repository contracts, Markdown/style checks, and a lease-protected publication gate. It published closure candidate `b59ed10f423d4a66e7e47d66ec764b7ff22531e7`.\n\nA final evidence-consistency review corrected stale references to the pre-validation staging SHA and replaced wording that contradicted the checked closure state. The owner-authored closure head `ae715e4b7ea045389933c1037da83394f7c1fe27` then passed all 25 inherited workflows, with zero failed, queued, in-progress, or cancelled runs and a successful aggregate Core CI status.\n\n## Design gate\n\nThis PR is governed by `docs/design-gates/NodalAnalogControlFlow-DG-v0.1.md`. It changes only closure state, immutable evidence, successor-aware checkers, mutation coverage, roadmap status, and evidence wording; it does not alter the accepted Increment 34 implementation semantics.\n\nResidual/DAE construction, solver execution, target legalization, and Verilog-A/Verilog-AMS procedural lowering remain deferred.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Merge reviewed implementation PR #109.\n- [x] Pass post-merge Core CI on the exact implementation merge.\n- [x] Pass independent exact post-merge Increment 34 validation.\n- [x] Make Increment 33 and Increment 34 checkers successor-aware.\n- [x] Add closure-state and premature-closure mutation coverage.\n- [x] Populate the validated Increment 34 manifest evidence.\n- [x] Advance the roadmap to revision 1.45 and check Increment 34.\n- [x] Publish and independently validate the closure candidate.\n- [x] Align all closure documents and roadmap links to the validated candidate.\n- [x] Pass the owner-authored closure exact-head workflow matrix.\n- [ ] Merge the evidence closure to `dev`.\n- [ ] Verify the final closure merge on `dev` with Core CI and dedicated validation.\n","created_at":"2026-09-03T13:12:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T18:50:33Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T18:47:56Z","merged_at":"2026-09-03T18:47:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"605de95da0d4a9ffb65cab7cfa31bd46a7f6d556","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pysolvesemi/Nodal/pulls/111/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pysolvesemi/Nodal/pulls/111/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pysolvesemi/Nodal/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pysolvesemi/Nodal/issues/111/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pysolvesemi/Nodal/statuses/ae715e4b7ea045389933c1037da83394f7c1fe27","head":{"label":"pysolvesemi:increment/34-evidence-closure-v1","ref":"increment/34-evidence-closure-v1","sha":"ae715e4b7ea045389933c1037da83394f7c1fe27","user":{"login":"pysolvesemi","id":173373701,"node_id":"U_kgDOClV5BQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173373701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pysolvesemi","html_url":"https://github.com/pysolvesemi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pysolvesemi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pysolvesemi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pysolvesemi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"htt